# DS-8 probe, an IC Housing: where each lever keeps its position.
# One of each on the housing's network, and no others of those kinds.
# Lever: r0 Open, r1 Setting. Switch: r2 Open, r3 Setting.
# BigLever: r4 Open, r5 Setting. FlipCoverSwitch: r6 Open, r7 Setting,
# r8 On. Modular Switch: r9 Setting, r10 On. FlipSwitch: r11 Setting,
# r12 On.
main:
yield
lb r0 HASH("StructureLogicSwitch") Open Sum
lb r1 HASH("StructureLogicSwitch") Setting Sum
lb r2 HASH("StructureLogicSwitch2") Open Sum
lb r3 HASH("StructureLogicSwitch2") Setting Sum
lb r4 HASH("ModularDeviceBigLever") Open Sum
lb r5 HASH("ModularDeviceBigLever") Setting Sum
lb r6 HASH("ModularDeviceFlipCoverSwitch") Open Sum
lb r7 HASH("ModularDeviceFlipCoverSwitch") Setting Sum
lb r8 HASH("ModularDeviceFlipCoverSwitch") On Sum
lb r9 HASH("ModularDeviceSwitch") Setting Sum
lb r10 HASH("ModularDeviceSwitch") On Sum
lb r11 HASH("ModularDeviceFlipSwitch") Setting Sum
lb r12 HASH("ModularDeviceFlipSwitch") On Sum
j main
